    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Crowley are delighted to offer this five bedroom residence with an adjoining one bedroom apartment, excellently situated in Murrisk, one of the West of Ireland's most sought after coastal locations.\n\nThe shoreline of Clew Bay and Murrisk Pier are just 250 metres' walk from the property making this a dream residence for a sailing or fishing enthusiast.\n\nThe architecturally designed house was built to a high standard circa 2006. Some of its quality features include oak flooring and internal doors, a painted oak kitchen and built in wardrobes. \n\nThe bright and spacious floor area of the main house extends to approximately 193.7 sq m (2,085 sq ft). Ground floor accommodation comprises of a substantial entrance hall, a south facing living room with wonderful Croagh Patrick views, a generously proportioned kitchen/dining room with patio doors to the rear terrace, utility room, an office/fifth bedroom overlooking Croagh Patrick and a family bathroom. On the first floor there are four double bedrooms (main with en-suite bathroom and walk-in wardrobe) and a shower room. \n\nTo the side, the own front door apartment has a floor area of approximately 20.09 sq m (225 sq ft), with an open plan living space overlooking Croagh Patrick and an en-suite bedroom. Murrisk is a popular holiday destination and the apartment offers excellent rental potential. \n\nGardens:\nExternally, the south facing house overlooks Croagh Patrick mountain and is set on generously sized gardens, great for outdoor dining and summer entertaining. There are extensive family friendly lawns to the front and rear, a west facing terrace perfect for catching the evening sun, and ample parking on the tarmac driveway. \n\nLocation:\nCarrowkeeran is situated in Murrisk, an attractive coastal village overlooking Clew Bay and sitting between Westport and Louisburgh towns on the world renowned Wild Atlantic Way. The village's amenities include Murrisk National School and two restaurant/bars, all within 1.2 km of the property. Murrisk Pier and a pebble beach are 250 metres from the house and a number of excellent sandy beaches are located within a short drive. Murrisk is the traditional starting point for the Croagh Patrick pilgrimage climb which attracts tens of thousands of visitors each year. Westport town and its many amenities are a ten minute drive."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 2.27m x 1.91m & 4.82m x 1.91m & 1.22m x 1.2m\nTiled entrance, oak floor, pine staircase\n\nLiving Room - 5.39m x 4.08m\nBright dual aspect room with Croagh Patrick views, oak floor, marble fireplace with solid fuel stove, blinds\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 4.2m x 3.87m & 3.36m x 3.01m\nOak and tiled floors, painted oak kitchen with solid oak countertops, Rangemaster gas/electric stove, solid fuel stove with back boiler, mountain views, patio doors to back garden, blinds\n\nUtility Room - 2.98m x 1.77m\nTiled floor, built in floor to ceiling storage units, fridge freezer, washing machine, dryer\n\nOffice/Bedroom - 4.59m x 3.98m\nBright dual aspect room with Croagh Patrick views, currently used as an office, oak floor, blinds\n\nCloakroom - 1.24m x 1.03m\nShelved\n\nBathroom - 2.76m x 2.56m\nTiled floor and splash backs, bath, wc, whb\n\nFirst Floor Landing - 3.07m x 2.05m & 1.52m x 1.34m\nOak floor, large walk-in hotpress, velux window\n\nBedroom One - 5.46m x 4.09m\nCroagh Patrick views, oak floor\n\nBedroom Two - 5.31m x 3.57m & 2.29m x 0.89m\nBright dual aspect room, oak floor\n\nEn-Suite - 2.17m x 2.08m\nTiled floor and splash backs, corner bath/shower, wc, whb\n\nWalk-in Wardrobe - 2.17m x 2.08m\nOak floor, shelved\n\nBedroom Three - 3.76m x 2.86m & 1.97m x 0.52m\nOak floor, built in wardrobe, velux window\n\nBedroom Four - 4.27m x 3.36m\nCroagh Patrick views, oak floor, built in wardrobe\n\nShower Room - 5.99m x 1.89m\nTiled floor and splash backs, shower, wc, whb, velux window\n\nAPARTMENT - \n\n\nLiving/Dining/Kitchen - 3.59m x 3.05m\nPatio doors overlooking Croagh Patrick, fitted kitchen, infrared heater\n\nBedroom - 2.84m x 2.5m\nInfrared heater\n\nEn-Suite - 2.84m x 1.0m\nTiled floor, shower, wc, whb\n\n"
